  "body": "## Finding description and location\nMinter pulls newly minted HYBR into `GaugeManager` and only updates `index` when `totalWeight > 0`. If no gauges have votes yet, the emission sits on the contract balance, `index` never increments, and that tranche is lost forever even after voting begins.\n\nCode snippet:\n\n```solidity\nIERC20Upgradeable(base).safeTransferFrom(msg.sender, address(this), amount);\n\nuint256 totalWeight = IVoter(voter).totalWeight();\nif (totalWeight > 0) {\n    uint256 ratio = amount * 1e18 / totalWeight;\n    if (ratio > 0) {\n        index += ratio;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Impact\nWhen no gauges have received votes yet (`totalWeight == 0`), the newly minted HYBR sits in `GaugeManager` without ever increasing `index`. Later epochs distribute normally, but the initial emissions remain orphaned. This permanently shrinks the reward pool and breaks accounting assumptions that minted tokens will flow into gauges.\n\n## Recommended Mitigation Steps\nFail when `totalWeight == 0`, or cache the amount in a pending bucket that is injected into the first epoch once votes exist.",
  "proof_of_concept": "## Proof of Concept\n1. See no `veNFT` has voted.\n2. Call `notifyRewardAmount(1 ether)` from the minter.\n3. Observe `GaugeManager` holds 1 HYBR, `index` unchanged. Even after votes are cast, that token never becomes claimable.\n\nPaste into `ve33/test/C4PoC.t.sol`:\n\n```solidity\npragma solidity 0.8.13;\n\nimport \"forge-std/Test.sol\";\nimport {C4PoCTestbed} from \"./C4PoCTestbed.t.sol\";\nimport {RewardHYBR} from \"../contracts/RewardHYBR.sol\";\n\ncontract C4PoC is C4PoCTestbed {\n    function test_M3_notifyRewardAmountWarehousesEmission() external {\n        uint256 orphanEmission = 7e18;\n\n        assertEq(hybr.balanceOf(address(gaugeManager)), 0, \"gauge manager dirty balance\");\n\n        hybr.transfer(address(minter), orphanEmission);\n        vm.prank(address(minter));\n        hybr.approve(address(gaugeManager), orphanEmission);\n\n        vm.prank(address(minter));\n        gaugeManager.notifyRewardAmount(orphanEmission);\n\n        assertEq(\n            hybr.balanceOf(address(gaugeManager)),\n            orphanEmission,\n            \"emission not retained in manager\"\n        );\n    }\n}\n```",
